<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>关于我们 (៸៸-ω(-ω-៸៸)</title>
<style>
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: #f0f7ff;
    font-family: -apple-system, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 32px 16px;
  }
  .app { width: 100%; max-width: 640px; }

  /* 顶部 */
  .topbar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .topbar h1 { font-size: 20px; color: #1e3a5f; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; }
  .topbar span { font-size: 12px; color: #7ba7cc; }

  /* 双人卡片 */
  .profiles {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) { .profiles { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 24px 20px 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(100, 150, 200, 0.1);
    text-align: center;
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }
  .card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); }

  /* 头像 */
  .avatar {
    width: 84px;
    height: 84px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    margin: 0 auto 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 32px;
    color: #fff;
    border: 3px solid #e0efff;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .avatar img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .name { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #1e3a5f; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .handle { font-size: 12px; color: #9bb8d4; margin-bottom: 14px; }

  /* 关注按钮 */
  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 7px 24px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }
  .btn:hover { opacity: 0.8; }
  .btn.follow { background: #7bb8e8; color: #fff; }

  /* 简介 */
  .bio {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #6b8aa8;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-top: 14px;
    padding-top: 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid #eef6ff;
    text-align: left;
  }

  /* 个人信息区域 */
  .info {
    margin-top: 12px;
    padding-top: 12px;
    border-top: 1px dashed #eef6ff;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .info .row {
    display: flex;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #6b8aa8;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .info .row .k {
    width: 62px;
    color: #9bb8d4;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .info .row .v { color: #5a8ab5; }

  /* 统计数字 */
  .stats {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 14px;
    padding-top: 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid #eef6ff;
  }
  .stats div { text-align: center; }
  .stats .num { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #1e3a5f; }
  .stats .label { font-size: 11px; color: #9bb8d4; margin-top: 2px; }

  /* 在一起的时间 */
  .together {
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(100, 150, 200, 0.1);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .together .title { font-size: 13px; color: #7ba7cc; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .timer { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; }
  .timer div {
    background: #f0f7ff;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    min-width: 58px;
  }
  .timer .num { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #5a8ab5; }
  .timer .label { font-size: 10px; color: #9bb8d4; margin-top: 2px; }

  .footer { text-align: center; margin-top: 24px; font-size: 11px; color: #b8d0e4; letter-spacing: 1px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="app">
    <div class="topbar">
      <h1>关于我们 (៸៸-ω(-ω-៸៸)</h1>
      <span>OUR SPACE</span>
    </div>

    <div class="profiles">
      <!-- ========== 左边：蓝桉 ========== -->
      <div class="card">
        <div class="avatar a">
          <img src="mmexport1790957480152.jpg" alt="头像">
        </div>
        <div class="name">蓝桉</div>
        <div class="handle">@lanan</div>
        <button class="btn follow">关注</button>

        <div class="bio">
          我們應該坐在一起看星星。
        </div>

        <div class="info">
          <div class="row"><span class="k">性格</span><span class="v">脾气古怪型选手 经常性烦躁易怒</span></div>
          <div class="row"><span class="k">星座</span><span class="v">巨蟹座</span></div>
          <div class="row"><span class="k">MBTI</span><span class="v">INFP</span></div>
          <div class="row"><span class="k">注意事项</span><span class="v">说话带句号不仅仅是因为心情不好。</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="stats">
          <div><div class="num">52</div><div class="label">动态</div></div>
          <div><div class="num">7.12k</div><div class="label">粉丝</div></div>
          <div><div class="num">1</div><div class="label">关注</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ========== 右边：知野 ========== -->
      <div class="card">
        <div class="avatar b">
          <img src="mmexport1790957477573.jpg" alt="头像">
        </div>
        <div class="name">知野</div>
        <div class="handle">@zhiye</div>
        <button class="btn follow">关注</button>

        <div class="bio">
          然后我說人類好渺小啊 你說愛很偉大啊。
        </div>

        <div class="info">
          <div class="row"><span class="k">性格</span><span class="v">做精吃醋型选手 经常没由来的闹脾气</span></div>
          <div class="row"><span class="k">星座</span><span class="v">双子座</span></div>
          <div class="row"><span class="k">MBTI</span><span class="v">INTP</span></div>
          <div class="row"><span class="k">注意事项</span><span class="v">心情经常在说话时外露 容易察觉。</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="stats">
          <div><div class="num">88</div><div class="label">动态</div></div>
          <div><div class="num">6.20k</div><div class="label">粉丝</div></div>
          <div><div class="num">1</div><div class="label">关注</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 计时器 -->
    <div class="together">
      <div class="title">我们在一起已经</div>
      <div class="timer" id="timer"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">MADE WITH ♡</div>
  </div>

<script>
  const startDate = new Date('2024-02-02T00:00:00');
  function update() {
    const now = new Date();
    const diff = now - startDate;
    const days = Math.floor(diff / 86400000);
    const hours = Math.floor(diff % 86400000 / 3600000);
    const mins = Math.floor(diff % 3600000 / 60000);
    const secs = Math.floor(diff % 60000 / 1000);
    document.getElementById('timer').innerHTML = `
      <div><div class="num">${days}</div><div class="label">天</div></div>
      <div><div class="num">${hours}</div><div class="label">时</div></div>
      <div><div class="num">${mins}</div><div class="label">分</div></div>
      <div><div class="num">${secs}</div><div class="label">秒</div></div>
    `;
  }
  update(); setInterval(update, 1000);
</script>
</body>
</html>
